{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonConditions","@type":"LeanModule","name":"FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonConditions","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":25,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.acoustic_horizon_hawking_temperature","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.acoustic_horizon_hawking_temperature","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L102-L108","doc":"**Brane Hawking temperature.** Substituting `ℏ_q = (q−1)/q` into\n`T_H = ℏ_q κ_H / (2π c_s)` gives `T_H = (q−1)/(2π q) · κ_H / c_s`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.acoustic_horizon_regularity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.acoustic_horizon_regularity","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L96-L100","doc":"**Non-degeneracy + energy condition** hold on the horizon surface. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.acoustic_horizon_conditions","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.acoustic_horizon_conditions","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L86-L94","doc":"**Acoustic horizon criterion** ([`prop:acoustic-horizon-conditions`]).\n\nOn the horizon surface `Σ` the flow is transonic (`|v| = c_s`), so the\nMach number reaches unity; the forward direction of\n`acoustic_horizon_criterion_iff`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:acoustic-horizon-conditions","label":"prop:acoustic-horizon-conditions","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.acoustic_horizon_criterion_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.acoustic_horizon_criterion_iff","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L75-L84","doc":"**Acoustic horizon criterion — equivalence** ([`prop:acoustic-horizon-conditions`]).\n\nA horizon forms *exactly* where the Mach number reaches unity:\n`|v| = c_s ⟺ ℳ = 1`. Both directions are proved from the definition\n`ℳ = |v|/c_s` and `c_s ≠ 0` (`a/c = 1 ↔ a = c`), so the Lean statement\nmatches the md's `⟺` criterion (md item (1)) rather than one direction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.hawking","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.hawking","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L73-L73","doc":"**Hawking temperature.** `T_H = ℏ_q κ_H / (2π c_s)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.energy_condition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.energy_condition","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L71-L71","doc":"**Energy condition.** The effective energy density is non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.nondegenerate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.nondegenerate","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L69-L69","doc":"**Non-degeneracy.** `∇(ℳ²) ≠ 0` on `Σ` (smooth hypersurface). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.transonic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.transonic","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L67-L67","doc":"**Horizon criterion.** On `Σ` the flow is transonic: `|v| = c_s`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.piConst_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.piConst_pos","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L65-L65","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.piConst","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.piConst","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L64-L64","doc":"`π` as an opaque positive constant (no analysis import needed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.hbar_brane","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.hbar_brane","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L62-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.hbar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.hbar","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L61-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.q_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.q_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L60-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.q","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Substrate parameter `q > 1` and brane quantum of action `ℏ_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.TH","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.TH","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.kappaH","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.kappaH","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L56-L56","doc":"Surface gravity `κ_H` and Hawking temperature `T_H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.T00","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.T00","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L54-L54","doc":"Effective energy density `T₀₀` (energy-condition quantity). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.gradMachSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.gradMachSq","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L52-L52","doc":"Gradient `∇(ℳ²)` of the squared Mach number on `Σ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.mach_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.mach_def","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L50-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.mach","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.mach","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Mach number `ℳ = |v| / c_s`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.cs_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.cs_pos","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L47-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.cs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.cs","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Local sound speed `c_s > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.vAbs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.vAbs","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Flow speed `|v|` on `Σ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.AcousticHorizonContext","kind":"class","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/acoustic-horizon-conditions.lean#L38-L73","doc":"Acoustic-horizon data on a surface `Σ`: flow speed `|v|`, sound speed\n`c_s`, Mach number `ℳ`, surface gravity `κ_H`, Hawking temperature\n`T_H`, the substrate `q`, the brane `ℏ_q`, and the load-bearing\nrelations. ","signatureChunk":0}]}